    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When the going gets tough, that's when you get going. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>When a creature scores a critical hit against you, you have advantage all attack rolls you make against that creature, until the end of your next turn.</li><li>If a critical hit against you drops you to 0 hit points, you drop instead to 1 hit point. You regain this ability when you roll initiative.</li></ul>",
